          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkudá' waawutmo Sargoni oo Ashuru geeraharusmoó úr oo slaqwaruuseerós nguwa ya/aáw, tari slaáqw nee gixsár Ashdodi, gari hayóh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qoomaadae AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Isaya, garmoó Amos gwaa báy, «Tlabaasingaá guniyadu duuxeek gawaá slaqwtoge nee ya/ataawo sleeme.» Isaya axweesantí gari iialooeés, gari tleéhh iri hi'iimiít ar /aankwets nee ya'aá tawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo kurkudá' gixsár Ashdodi kawa hayóh, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iri oó', «Ar adoodá' sagadiyusmooeé' Isaya ira hi'iimiít ar /aankwets nee ya'aá tawo, as iwa laya tleehhiti nee slaqsaay oo tleehharuút dír múk Misri nee oo Kushiro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gawaá adoorihe waawutmoó Ashuru múk Misri nee oo Kushiro gu ar tláy baraá lawaali'iima, múk urén nee na/iiwo. Ginar tláy awa /aankwets nee ya'aá tawo nee gwe'ede tsee/a, múk Misri kuri mureekees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní mukdá' sleémeero oo múk Kushi gwaa harahhiif, nee kudá' Misri gara daara/uut, tan daandeemo feehhamiit, tari amoqwaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadae yaamuuloouusér afaá tlawi iri o', ‹Qaytsité', mukdá' atén ta harahhifaafitaan gár gwaa sleer, kudá' tay gwaagowaan tiwa tu/iya' dír waawutmoó Ashuruwo. Hám daxta atén adór tar /uwaan?› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
